{"id":"7b1ff54ac76ee59d","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-zfc-comp-computably-enumerable-set.md","title":"ZFC Comp Computably Enumerable Set","display":"df-zfc-comp-computably-enumerable-set — ZFC Comp Computably Enumerable Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-comp-computably-enumerable-set","aliases":["58-df-zfc-comp-computably-enumerable-set"],"display":"df-zfc-comp-computably-enumerable-set — ZFC Comp Computably Enumerable Set","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-set]]","[[58-df-recursive]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-comp-computably-enumerable-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-comp-computably-enumerable-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-comp-computably-enumerable-set — ZFC Comp Computably Enumerable Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"58-df-set\">58-df-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"da0bcf2e3f060472\" href=\"?note=da0bcf2e3f060472\" title=\"58-df-recursive\">58-df-recursive</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span> (set of natural numbers)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{Rec}\\cap\\omega^\\omega\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{Rec}\\cap\\omega^\\omega\\)</span> (total recursive enumeration witness)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rec}\">\\(\\mathrm{Rec}\\)</span> (set of total recursive functions)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCompComputablyEnumerableSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCompComputablyEnumerableSet}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comp\\text{-}computably\\text{-}enumerable\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCompComputablyEnumerableSet}_S(A)\\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq\\omega\\land\\Bigl(A=\\varnothing\\lor\\exists f\\in\\mathrm{Rec}\\cap\\omega^\\omega\\;(A=\\operatorname{ran}(f))\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comp\\text{-}computably\\text{-}enumerable\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCompComputablyEnumerableSet}_S(A)\\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq\\omega\\land\\Bigl(A=\\varnothing\\lor\\exists f\\in\\mathrm{Rec}\\cap\\omega^\\omega\\;(A=\\operatorname{ran}(f))\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A nonempty c.e. set is exactly the range of a total unary recursive function; the empty set is handled separately.  This equivalent characterization removes the circular dependency through partial computability and Turing functionals.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-set","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"da0bcf2e3f060472","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-recursive]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{Rec}\\cap\\omega^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rec}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcCompComputablyEnumerableSet}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comp\\text{-}computably\\text{-}enumerable\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCompComputablyEnumerableSet}_S(A)\\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq\\omega\\land\\Bigl(A=\\varnothing\\lor\\exists f\\in\\mathrm{Rec}\\cap\\omega^\\omega\\;(A=\\operatorname{ran}(f))\\Bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1208,"backlinks":[{"id":"f032216255883436","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{ZfcCompComputablyEnumerableSet}$ 取 [[../batch20/58-df-zfc-comp-computably-enumerable-set.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。"},{"id":"967fd715c999aad8","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"7f0d78eba77f4a30","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"26eb5b3a994871b2","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcCompComputablyEnumerableSet}_S$ (computably-enumerable subset of $\\omega$, see [[../batch20/58-df-zfc-comp-computably-enumerable-set.md]])"},{"id":"be9c2609f02de522","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcCompComputablyEnumerableSet}_S\\subseteq V$ (c.e. 自然数集谓词, see [[../batch20/58-df-zfc-comp-computably-enumerable-set.md]])"},{"id":"618dc6ad8d6c1e22","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1751","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-zfc-comp-computably-enumerable-set.md|58-df-zfc-comp-computably-enumerable-set]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","65d9a1e690c32aad","da0bcf2e3f060472"]}